  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "\u0110\u1EA5u s\u0129"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\r\n[Fearsome]\r\n- ch\u1EC9
    k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch v\u1EDBi 3 ST tr\u1EDF l\xEAn c\xF3 th\u1EC3 th\u1EE7."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 qu\u1EF7 m\u1ED9t gi\xF2 \u2014 b\xF3ng qu\u1EF7 ch\u1EC9 c\xF3
    m\u1ED9t ch\xE2n, th\u01B0\u1EDDng nh\u1EA3y qua \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng v\u1EAFng
    v\xE0 r\u1EEBng n\xFAi l\xFAc \u0111\xEAm khuya. H\xECnh d\xE1ng khuy\u1EBFt
    d\u1ECB c\u1EE7a ta \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 d\u1ECDa ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    kh\xF4ng n\xEAn \u0111i m\u1ED9t m\xECnh."
